      "id": "dd8d26b32f62-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) and continue the given series. 67, 71, 79, 91, 107, ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the number from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) and continue the given series.</p>\n\n<p>67, 71, 79, 91, 107, ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "127",
          "html": "127"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "131",
          "html": "131"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "119",
          "html": "119"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "123",
          "html": "123"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">67 +<strong> 4</strong> = 71</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">71 +<strong> 8</strong>&nbsp;= 79</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">79 + <strong>12</strong> = 91</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">91 + <strong>16</strong> = 107</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">107 + <strong>20</strong> = <strong>127&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In the above series,<strong> multiple of 4 is added</strong> to each number in the increasing order.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>&quot;127&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
