    {
      "id": "dd8d26b32f62-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Which number will replace the question mark (?) in the following series? 20, 41, 84, 171, 346, ?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which number will replace the question mark (?) in the following series?</p>\n\n<p>20, 41, 84, 171, 346, ?</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "671",
          "html": "671"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1020",
          "html": "1020"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "697",
          "html": "697"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "691",
          "html": "691"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>20&nbsp;&times; 2 + 1 = 41</p>\n\n<p>41 &times; 2 + 2&nbsp;= 84</p>\n\n<p>84 &times; 2 + 3&nbsp;= 171</p>\n\n<p>171 &times; 2 + 4&nbsp;= 346</p>\n\n<p><strong>346 &times; 2 + 5&nbsp;= 697</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence,<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;697</span>&nbsp;is&nbsp;the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
